<view class="page"><view class="card"><text class="title">积分充值</text><view class="notice">请先扫码付款，并在付款备注填写网站用户名；再提交金额。管理员核对到账后手动审核，本站不会自动识别付款或自动到账。</view><view class="muted">当前账号：{{username}}</view><input class="input amount" type="digit" placeholder="充值金额（元）" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="onAmount"/><input class="input" maxlength="100" placeholder="付款备注或补充说明（选填）" value="{{note}}" bindinput="onNote"/><view class="section-title">选择收款方式</view><view class="methods"><view class="method {{method==='alipay'?'selected':''}}" data-method="alipay" bindtap="selectMethod">支付宝</view><view class="method {{method==='wechat'?'selected':''}}" data-method="wechat" bindtap="selectMethod">微信支付</view></view><image class="qr" src="{{qrUrl}}" mode="widthFix"/><button class="btn" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">提交充值申请</button></view><view class="section-title">我的充值记录</view><view class="card record" wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><text>{{item.amount}} 元 · {{item.method==='alipay'?'支付宝':'微信'}}</text><text class="state {{item.status==='rejected'?'red':''}}">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.timeText}}{{item.points?' · '+item.points+' 积分':''}}</view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!records.length}}">暂无充值申请</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view></view>
